    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/4aadc0b84ea7c8210651237c1654049c.avif?t=1700141580\" width=616 height=118 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/959c1a47af27dcc75c80b3e3089bb1bd.poster.avif?t=1700141580\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/959c1a47af27dcc75c80b3e3089bb1bd.webm?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/959c1a47af27dcc75c80b3e3089bb1bd.mp4?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Immerse yourself in the spine-chilling world of our horror game like never before with our Virtual Reality (VR) feature. By donning your VR headset, you'll be transported into a terrifying dimension where every creak, shadow, and eerie sound feels unbelievably real.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description of the Game</strong></h2>Paranormal Capture Investigation is a first-person horror game that plunges players into an oppressive atmosphere, forcing them to confront their deepest fears. Based on the developers' real-life personal experience, you'll need courage and insight to gather convincing evidence of the existence of ghosts, while surviving the terrifying ordeals that await you. Prepare to be haunted by unforgettable supernatural experiences in this exciting horror game. Will you dare to face the unknown?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/b8fc3be1f0219cc67980844af6df3a7c.avif?t=1700141580\" width=616 height=118 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/3ae02e1b86ba82790bee10b5c41861de.poster.avif?t=1700141580\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/3ae02e1b86ba82790bee10b5c41861de.webm?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/3ae02e1b86ba82790bee10b5c41861de.mp4?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Wander through sinister, still-inhabited houses, each teeming with paranormal phenomena.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/a2eca23e8ad89248728cbf73e0d4f95c.avif?t=1700141580\" width=616 height=118 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/27b0ef069d08b6a5cdc3feb100b2f556.poster.avif?t=1700141580\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/27b0ef069d08b6a5cdc3feb100b2f556.webm?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/27b0ef069d08b6a5cdc3feb100b2f556.mp4?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Equip yourself with sophisticated detection equipment, such as EMF detectors, SpiritBoxes and temperature sensors, based on the knowledge acquired by our paranormal investigators, to collect evidence of the existence of the afterlife.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/fce25dac4d6d2a2e7ffd5e7df88d1368.avif?t=1700141580\" width=616 height=118 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/8496920dd83440046f41890a03b897aa.poster.avif?t=1700141580\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/8496920dd83440046f41890a03b897aa.webm?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/8496920dd83440046f41890a03b897aa.mp4?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Participate in several paranormal investigations to unlock new locations with our progressive level and experience system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/eaa4fd004ffd8ab47e3ba5069a506625.avif?t=1700141580\" width=616 height=118 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/8f5bb076c7590125cb47179052bba6a1.poster.avif?t=1700141580\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/8f5bb076c7590125cb47179052bba6a1.webm?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/8f5bb076c7590125cb47179052bba6a1.mp4?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Be prepared to face frightening apparitions and hostile spectres who will try to prevent you from discovering the truth.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description of the Game</strong></h2>Paranormal Capture Investigation is a first-person horror game that plunges players into an oppressive atmosphere, forcing them to confront their deepest fears. Based on the developers' real-life personal experience, you'll need courage and insight to gather convincing evidence of the existence of ghosts, while surviving the terrifying ordeals that await you. Prepare to be haunted by unforgettable supernatural experiences in this exciting horror game. Will you dare to face the unknown?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/b8fc3be1f0219cc67980844af6df3a7c.avif?t=1700141580\" width=616 height=118 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/3ae02e1b86ba82790bee10b5c41861de.poster.avif?t=1700141580\" width=600 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/3ae02e1b86ba82790bee10b5c41861de.webm?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/3ae02e1b86ba82790bee10b5c41861de.mp4?t=1700141580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Wander through sinister, still-inhabited houses, each teeming with paranormal phenomena.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/a2eca23e8ad89248728cbf73e0d4f95c.avif?t=1700141580\" width=616 height=118 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2679320/extras/27b0ef069d08b6a5cdc3feb100b2f556.poster.avif?t=1700141580\" width=600 h